      "content": "PICCOTT'S END 1. 5252                                                   (West Side)                                                   No 117 (Piccott's TL 0509 8/218             20.5.54.                End Farmhouse) II 2. C16 or early C17.  Timber frame, red brick nogging and plaster infilling, ground floor road front wall rebuilt in whitewashed brick.  Old tiled roof, hipped on north, with plain early red brick chimneystack.  2 storeys.  North elevation has 2 casement windows to lst floor, 1 to ground floor. Listing NGR: TL0477609116"
    }
